# Hugo's output and its caches.
public/
resources/
.hugo_build.lock

# ⛔ A background command's log. The rule that keeps such logs out of volatile
# directories sends them HERE, where `git add -A` sweeps them into a commit —
# which happened once in go-pdfkit/reader and had to be corrected. One of these
# was sitting untracked in this clone when this line was written.
.prwait-*.log
